# Build context filter for docker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore
# in preference to a root .dockerignore, so this stays out of the repo root).

# The one that matters: on a mac checkout this holds darwin binaries — an
# Electron.app bundle and a Mach-O node-pty — which are useless in a linux image
# and would be several hundred MB of context to upload before being overwritten.
node_modules
**/node_modules

.git
.github
dist
smoke

# Emitted output is gitignored and rebuilt in the image; copying a mac build's
# emits in would only make the layer cache lie about what was compiled.
main.mjs
main.mjs.map
main/*.mjs
main/*.mjs.map
preload.js
preload.js.map
renderer/*.js
renderer/*.js.map

Casks
docs
*.dmg
*.zip
*.AppImage
